    "zh": "该接口为[异步接口](~~3027141~~)，提交任务后返回任务ID（此时任务尚未完成，任务将进入后台排队异步执行），最终结果将通过回调通知，也可通过[查询截图任务详细信息](~~441203~~)主动查询任务状态。",
    "en": "This is an [asynchronous interface](~~3027141~~). Submitting a task returns a task ID and queues it for asynchronous processing. A callback delivers the final result. Alternatively, you can check the task status by [querying screenshot task details](~~441203~~)."
